WEBVTT

00:07:29.565 --> 00:07:31.604
when the word of the year was "Plutoed,"

00:07:31.604 --> 00:07:33.596
to mean demoted.

00:07:33.596 --> 00:07:37.351
(Laughter)

00:07:38.586 --> 00:07:40.955
But some of the past winners

00:07:40.955 --> 00:07:43.870
now seem completely unremarkable,

00:07:43.870 --> 00:07:45.388
such as "app"

00:07:45.388 --> 00:07:47.401
and "e" as a prefix,

00:07:47.401 --> 00:07:50.360
and "google" as a verb.

00:07:50.360 --> 00:07:54.427
Now, a few weeks before our vote,

00:07:54.427 --> 00:07:56.208
Lake Superior State University

00:07:56.208 --> 00:08:00.987
issues its list of banished words for the year.